Photographs by Yuval Kolodkin-Gal
https://github.com/yuvalkolodkingal/Wallpapers

Included in Arctic Linux at the photographer's explicit request. The upstream
COPYRIGHT notice is preserved alongside the exported photographs. This inclusion
does not grant a new general license or relicense these photos under Arctic's
software license. The source revision and image checksums are in collection.json.

Only the published photo masters and collection metadata are packaged. Original
captures, editing projects, previews and duplicate resolutions are excluded.
The older Arctic illustrations remain solely for existing wallpaper selections;
fresh desktop, lock and greeter defaults use this photo collection.
